 "description": "<p>The Japanese school swimsuit reference in white polyester, one size for 40-60 kg. This is the full-coverage version of the campus swimsuit category - a one-piece cut with the school silhouette rather than the costume adaptation of it.</p>\n<p>White is the less common choice for this genre, where navy dominates, and it changes the read completely: less uniform, more costume. The cut stays true to the reference with a high back and a fitted line.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Item type: one-piece swimsuit</li>\n<li>Style: Japanese school</li>\n<li>Color: white</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The authentic-cut option in a category full of loose interpretations.</p>\n",
